{"2455360": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Cooking Simulator 2: Better Together", "steam_appid": 2455360, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Every great chef starts somewhere.</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Open the doors to your own restaurant, <strong>master</strong> authentic cooking techniques, and turn simple ingredients into unforgettable dishes. <strong>Learn, experiment, improve, and earn</strong> the reputation of one of the city's finest chefs. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you dream of running a perfectly organized kitchen or creating culinary masterpieces your own way, every service is another opportunity to prove yourself. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2455360/extras/25237bc261e6b6d4d9db7e583e32fad4.poster.avif?t=1785913181\" width=1170 height=456 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2455360/extras/25237bc261e6b6d4d9db7e583e32fad4.webm?t=1785913181\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Cook Your Way</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cooking is more than following recipes.</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Slice, season, fry, bake, grill, boil, and plate every dish</strong> with precision using professional kitchen equipment and intuitive controls. Control temperatures, perfect your timing, and discover how every ingredient affects the final result. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Success depends on your skill - not luck.</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Create Original Recipes</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Why stop at following instructions?</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Develop your own signature dishes using the Blueprint system. Modify existing recipes, experiment with ingredients, discover new flavor combinations, and create meals that become customer favorites. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Collect recipes inspired by cuisines from around the world, then make every one of them uniquely yours</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2455360/extras/3816b77206bfa2898c845d0388dfa18d.poster.avif?t=1785913181\" width=1170 height=456 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2455360/extras/3816b77206bfa2898c845d0388dfa18d.webm?t=1785913181\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Build a Restaurant Worth Visiting</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Running a successful restaurant means much more than cooking. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Prepare ingredients</strong> before service, <strong>organize</strong> your workstations, <strong>manage</strong> supplies, keep orders flowing, and satisfy guests with different personalities, expectations, and preferences. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every decision affects your reputation - <strong>and every service teaches you something new.</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Play Alone or Cook Together</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The entire experience can be enjoyed solo or in optional online co-op.</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Invite friends</strong> into your restaurant, divide responsibilities, <strong>coordinate</strong> during busy rush hours, or simply relax in <strong>Sandbox Mode</strong> and experiment without limits. Work together to create the perfect kitchen - or embrace the inevitable chaos. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2455360/extras/466324502c9640e90d1e93dab1a4b9d6.poster.avif?t=1785913181\" width=1170 height=456 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2455360/extras/466324502c9640e90d1e93dab1a4b9d6.webm?t=1785913181\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Grow Into a Master Chef</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Every successful service brings new opportunities.</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Earn experience, unlock skills and perks, improve your efficiency, and master increasingly advanced cooking techniques.</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete culinary challenges from the prestigious Concorde Culinaire and prove that your restaurant deserves recognition among the world's best. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Make It Yours</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Between services, head back to your apartment.</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experiment with recipes, practice new techniques, or simply unwind after a busy day. Customize your chef with different hairstyles, outfits, tattoos, and accessories to create a look that's entirely your own. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Sometimes Chaos Is the Main Course</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Not every day in the kitchen goes according to plan.</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Burn a steak. Drop a plate. Throw a pan across the room. Set off a spectacular mess just because you can. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sometimes the best way to end a stressful shift is with a little perfectly harmless kitchen chaos. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2455360/extras/75e048faee7dab7d418e8448ac179669.poster.avif?t=1785913181\" width=1170 height=456 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2455360/extras/75e048faee7dab7d418e8448ac179669.webm?t=1785913181\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2455360/extras/75e048faee7dab7d418e8448ac179669.mp4?t=1785913181\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Key Features:</strong> </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Master</strong> authentic cooking mechanics using professional kitchen equipment.  </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Create, customize, and save</strong> your own original recipes with the Blueprint system.  </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run a busy restaurant and serve guests with unique expectations and personalities.  </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play the entire game <strong>solo</strong> or in <strong>optional online co-op with</strong> friends.  </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new <strong>skills, perks, and advanced culinary techniques</strong> as you progress.  </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete prestigious <strong>Concorde Culinaire</strong> challenges to earn mastery seals.  </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customize</strong> your chef, decorate your apartment, and experiment freely between services.  </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relax in <strong>Sandbox Mode</strong> or unleash spectacular kitchen chaos whenever you feel like it. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Every great chef starts somewhere.</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Open the doors to your own restaurant, <strong>master</strong> authentic cooking techniques, and turn simple ingredients into unforgettable dishes. <strong>Learn, experiment, improve, and earn</strong> the reputation of one of the city's finest chefs. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you dream of running a perfectly organized kitchen or creating culinary masterpieces your own way, every service is another opportunity to prove yourself. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2455360/extras/25237bc261e6b6d4d9db7e583e32fad4.poster.avif?t=1785913181\" width=1170 height=456 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2455360/extras/25237bc261e6b6d4d9db7e583e32fad4.webm?t=1785913181\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Cook Your Way</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cooking is more than following recipes.</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Slice, season, fry, bake, grill, boil, and plate every dish</strong> with precision using professional kitchen equipment and intuitive controls. Control temperatures, perfect your timing, and discover how every ingredient affects the final result. </p><p c